# STRIDE DFD: an IoT thermostat communicates through an untrusted home network to cloud services and telemetry storage.
threatmodel "IoT Cloud Backend STRIDE"
external Device: Smart Thermostat
external Owner: Homeowner App
process Gateway: IoT Cloud Gateway
process Control: Device Control Service
datastore Telemetry: Telemetry Store
datastore Audit: Device Audit Log
Device -> Gateway : MQTT telemetry
Owner -> Gateway : control request
Gateway -> Control : authenticated command
Control -> Device : device command
Gateway -> Telemetry : readings
Control -> Audit : command audit
boundary "Home Internet" { Device, Owner }
boundary "Cloud Edge" { Gateway }
boundary "Cloud Internal" { Control, Telemetry, Audit }
